zeozer esan beharko luke:','https://gravatar.com/'=>'https://gravatar.com/','Hi, this is a comment.
To get started with moderating, editing, and deleting comments, please visit the Comments screen in the dashboard.
Commenter avatars come from <a href="%s">Gravatar</a>.'=>'Epa, hau iruzkin bat da.
