ates'=>'Eguneraketa Automatikoak','Plugin'=>'Plugina','No plugins are currently available.'=>'Une honetan ez dago pluginik eskuragarri.','No plugins found.'=>'Ez da pluginik aurkitu.','Search for plugins in the WordPress Plugin Directory.'=>'Bilatu pluginak WordPresseko pluginen direktorioan.','No plugins found for: %s.'=>'Ez da %s-(r)entzat pluginik aurkitu.','Additional plugins are required'=>'Plugin osagarriak beharrezkoak dira','<strong>Compatible</strong> with your version of WordPress'=>'<strong>Badabil</strong> zure WordPress bertsioarekin','<strong>Incompatible</strong> with your version of WordPress'=>'<strong>Ez dabil</strong> zure WordPress bertsioarekin','Untested with your version of WordPress'=>'Ez da probatu zure WordPress bertsioarekin','%s Active Installations'=>'%s instalazio aktibo','Active plugin installationsLess Than 10'=>'10 baino gutxiago','Active plugin installations%s+ Million'=>'Milioi 1+','Last Updated:'=>'Azken eguneraketa:','This plugin does not work with your version of PHP.'=>'Plugin hau ez da bateragarria zure PHP bertsioarekin.','This plugin does not work with your version of WordPress.'=>'Plugin hau ez da bateragarria zure WordPress bertsioarekin.','This plugin does not work with your versions of WordPress and PHP.'=>'Plugin honek ez du zure PHP eta WordPress bertsioekin funtzionatzen.','More Details'=>'Xehetasun gehiago','Plugin installer group titleTools'=>'Tresnak','Plugin installer group titleSocial'=>'Soziala','Plugin installer group titlePerformance'=>'Errendimendua','No plugins found. Try a different search.'=>'Ez da pluginik aurkitu. Saiatu beste bilaketa batekin.','Try Again'=>'Saiatu berriz','Upload Plugin'=>'Igo plugina','Plugin InstallerFavorites'=>'Gogokoak','Plugin InstallerRecommended'=>'Gomendioak','Plugin InstallerPopular'=>'Erabilienak','Plugin InstallerFeatured'=>'Nabarmenduak','Plugin InstallerBeta Testing'=>'Beta egiaztapena','Search Results'=>'Bilaketaren emaitzak','Download &#8220;%s&#8221;'=>'Deska