Eskerrik asko! -- WordPress taldea','FAILED: %s'=>'ERROREA: %s','The following translations failed to update:'=>'Itzulpen hauek ondo ez dira ondo eguneratu:','The following themes failed to update:'=>'Itxura hauek ondo ez dira ondo eguneratu:','The following plugins failed to update:'=>'Plugin hauek ondo ez dira ondo eguneratu:','SUCCESS: %s'=>'ONDO!: %s','The following translations were successfully updated:'=>'Itzulpen hauek ondo eguneratu dira:','The following themes were successfully updated:'=>'Itxura hauek ondo eguneratu dira:','The following plugins were successfully updated:'=>'Plugin hauek ondo eguneratu dira:','FAILED: WordPress failed to update to %s'=>'ERROREA: Huts egin du WordPress %s bertsiora eguneratzean','SUCCESS: WordPress was successfully updated to %s'=>'ONDO: WordPress ondo eguneratu da %s bertsiora','WordPress site: %s'=>'WordPress gunea: %s','To manage themes on your site, visit the Themes page: %s'=>'Zure gunean itxurak kudeatzeko, joan pluginen orrira: %s','To manage plugins on your site, visit the Plugins page: %s'=>'Zure gunean pluginak kudeatzeko, joan pluginen orrira: %s','These themes are now up to date:'=>'Itxura hauek eguneratuta daude orain:','These plugins are now up to date:'=>'Plugin hauek eguneratuta daude orain:','- %1$s version %2$s'=>'- %1$s %2$s bertsioa','- %1$s (from version %2$s to %3$s)'=>'- %1$s ( %2$s bertsiotik %3$s-(e)ra)','These themes failed to update:'=>'Itxura hauek ez dira ondo eguneratu:','- %1$s version %2$s%3$s'=>'- %1$s %2$s bertsioa %3$s','- %1$s (from version %2$s to %3$s)%4$s'=>'- %1$s ( %2$s bertsiotik %3$s(e)ra)%4$s','The following plugins failed to update. If there was a fatal error in the update, the previously installed version has been restored.'=>'Plugin hauek huts egin dute eguneratzerakoan. Errore larri bat gertatu baldin bada, lehen instalatuta zegoen bertsioa berrezarri da.','Please check your site now. It’s possible that everything is working. If there are updates available, you should update.